        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It appears as an eye-like small Gu worm that hovers quietly while its eyes move and scan, and it is not a wild Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          718
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
