  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Constant use spends primeval essence and burdens the soul. Fang Yuan judges invisible methods can pass the watch boldly.",
        "chapters": [
          718
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He also notes that the Gu is often paired with True Sight Gu, which can then detect stealth and invisibility, though that pairing belongs to a later era of wider use.",
        "chapters": [
          718
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_true_sight_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan hide their bodies, enter its range, and draw no Gu Immortal attention. Along the same path they find similar investigative Gu of the same type, some buried, some disguised as leaves, and some drifting in brooks.",
        "chapters": [
          719
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
